{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1000_p", "source_sha256": "50c438e95dca44549d192aa41ffac1900b1cc31c73eeb803642ad08175aa30a3", "ja": "ひなた、お疲れさま。\n新しい衣装、気に入ってくれたか？", "zh": "日向，辛苦了。\n你喜欢这套新服装吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1001_035hin", "source_sha256": "5b8298460035c8422c22967565f749d595595747d337a2f1f0f70b3482a59bb9", "ja": "えへへ、もちろんだよぉ。こんなステキな衣装を\n着られるなんて、なまらうれしいべさ。", "zh": "嘿嘿，当然喜欢呀。能穿上这么漂亮的服装，真是开心得不得了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "345664cc1b84e7245f3370e27a9b0b3d9d2e424f51e6d1ada9e4078261d0e70e", "ja": "あ、でも……{$P$}。\nあたし、ちゃんと着こなせてるんかなぁ？", "zh": "啊，不过……{$P$}。\n我真的把这身衣服穿得好看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1003_035hin", "source_sha256": "9e00bf788c29d89ae5e84ac002269d8140218e85fb5a3905b7fce89ff7f883f0", "ja": "この衣装、ビシッとしてて、なまらカッコいい\n感じでしょや？　あたしに似合うんかなぁって……。", "zh": "这套服装很利落，特别帅气，对吧？我就在想，不知道适不适合我……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1004_p", "source_sha256": "6519d8193e7dcd241d2a066b5d7bab149ff71eaa403002e669114cbd74e17676", "ja": "確かに、普段のひなたのイメージとは少し違うかもな。\nでもギャップがあって、いいと思うよ。", "zh": "确实，这和平时的阳向给人的印象有点不一样呢。\n不过正因为有这种反差，我觉得挺好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1005_035hin", "source_sha256": "8798f56cf851bd5b991ad36bb06d78b3ff90a7be1f9661ef80ed09cb4edc5306", "ja": "ギャップかぁ……だけどあたし、この衣装は\nちゃんとカッコよく着こなしたいなぁ。", "zh": "反差啊……不过这套服装，我还是想好好穿出帅气的感觉。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1006_p", "source_sha256": "f34c4c5a2909a5a89edb5d546a1feb769f78662ca6ad6341735e315efcd75e89", "ja": "うーん……それなら、\nちょっと演技してみたらどうだろう？", "zh": "嗯……那样的话，要不要试着演一下？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1007_p", "source_sha256": "91c18c9a65653d2e5b605879808fd6489563bb09231315d5cb7a231331661159", "ja": "その衣装は、海軍の提督をイメージしたものだからな。\nそういう演技をしてみたらいいんじゃないか？", "zh": "那套服装是以海军提督为原型设计的。\n要不要试着演演看那种感觉？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "7b7d2ea4aa65548522521d7770217df6e1d1385a438c189016bee0d7d27b3a38", "ja": "なるほどねぇ！　確かにそうすれば、\nイメージが掴めるかもだわ。", "zh": "原来如此！确实，这样一来，\n或许就能抓住那种感觉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1009_035hin", "source_sha256": "930281cf33a649b554fa226a86c80a355de6756d5c7d689da3d0883d79ac4975", "ja": "したっけ{$P$}、\nやってみるから、見ててもらってもいいだろか？", "zh": "那我就试试看，{$P$}，你可以看着吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b40d71e782f68364b8d15962ab77040beddbf505db8ea92558e1d398ba9d1199", "ja": "ああ、もちろん！　見せてもらうよ。", "zh": "啊，当然！我会看着的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "1c1b22f6d3707c892e9755b514c511bb4e77ff2a89c9e6a13b098ed3bac3f56e", "ja": "こほん……。財宝に目がくらんだ海賊たち！　\n今日こそお前たちを捕まえてやるぞっ！", "zh": "咳咳……被财宝迷住双眼的海盗们！今天一定要把你们抓起来！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1012_p", "source_sha256": "08f7cf46e7b3e2bf4a219f420090613d2c119cb9c275684f1b721c01b27f7a94", "ja": "おっ、キマってるじゃないか！　その調子だ！", "zh": "哦，演得很像嘛！就保持这个劲头！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1013_035hin", "source_sha256": "71ed15ba805f025edcaaa6db95555bed8b4509f7969bd7cae5ee165dd94d1529", "ja": "逃げても無駄だっ！　地の果てまでも追い詰めて、\nお前たちを……お、お前たちを……ううっ。", "zh": "逃也没用！我会追你们到天涯海角，把你们……把、把你们……呜呜。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1014_p", "source_sha256": "11874ec3aaa291a100100fba231ac3bf216025209b73ba7fb8bfbdeaae3b2127", "ja": "……ひなた？", "zh": "……日向？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1015_035hin", "source_sha256": "0264643d6fb6f948aa48d09f584dd3e3dc648e992b33026197a5202c96b45fe5", "ja": "うぅ……こういう台詞は、\nどうしても気になってしまうんだわ。", "zh": "呜呜……这种台词，\n总是会让我很在意。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1016_035hin", "source_sha256": "f7e5560f2178c37acd97c5ba4e94a7c760326286662e499d8bb3f33975151fbf", "ja": "言われた方が、悲しい気持ちになるんじゃ\nないかって……ダメだねぇ、あたし……。", "zh": "因为被那样说的人，可能会感到难过吧……\n我这样可不行呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1017_p", "source_sha256": "ea05ece85bd3528b51d9a60a1801b09dd8281c2d6bc5deb95e125c8a058d0f97", "ja": "いや、いいと思うよ。ただ勇敢なだけより、\nそうやって悩む人の方が、人間味があるしな。", "zh": "不，我觉得挺好的。比起一味勇敢，\n像你这样会烦恼的人，反而更有同理心嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "7792cc4fea6e6cb6aca709b81a8745baec2fad2aaf3f313db77e2b78a03adcb7", "ja": "え……でも……？\nこの衣装は、勇敢な提督の衣装でしょや？", "zh": "诶……可是……？\n这套服装，是勇敢提督的服装对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1019_p", "source_sha256": "a98567379ef8acd2e9936e3d93fc6cfb7f0259ea183aec9133ed02428279bf77", "ja": "うん、でも、正義の提督だって、\nなにひとつ悩みがないなんてことはないだろうし。", "zh": "嗯，不过，正义的提督也不可能一点烦恼都没有吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1020_p", "source_sha256": "c2d3d70c1c8f255ad74d780c82d9c4ce9f10ebdaaa068683fb9dfb4e80a4bca7", "ja": "悩んで、悩んで……それでも、譲れない気持ちで\n戦うっていうのは、カッコいいと思うよ。", "zh": "苦恼着、苦恼着……即便如此，仍怀着不愿退让的心情去战斗，我觉得很帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "48433e51f2edc1625d14f0697804ef3ce4cbcd7507d8b8c8ff6e1cf7f328b003", "ja": "そっかぁ……そうだねぇ。\nあたしもそういうの、カッコいいと思うわ。", "zh": "这样啊……确实呢。\n我也觉得那样很帅气。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1022_035hin", "source_sha256": "1434e1aec95ecf9e8f127e7bf71e62c8e080f5954e1b0a058cd66a813de91c28", "ja": "えへへ……ありがとねぇ、{$P$}。\nあたしも、そういうカッコよさを目指してみるよぉ！", "zh": "嘿嘿……谢谢你，{$P$}。\n我也要试着朝那样的帅气努力！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_035hin0244_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_035hin0244_1023_035hin", "source_sha256": "fef5f1e00a1b67551e41102c2fc08d78a589bc7bda81029018f55681de7d70f0", "ja": "悩んでも、悩んでも……。\nきっと、この衣装を着こなしてみせるべさ！", "zh": "就算烦恼，再怎么烦恼……  \n我也一定会把这身服装穿出风采的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
